{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013BTKFVLtmACNAkVvHJTLNn","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"Make the repo root importable, whatever pytest was invoked as.\n2\t\n3\tWithout this, `from evals import ...` / `from config import settings` resolve only\n4\tbecause CI happens to run `python -m pytest` — the `-m` flag puts the CWD on\n5\tsys.path. A bare `pytest tests/` from the repo root fails to import, because\n6\tpytest's default `prepend` import mode adds only the test file's own rootdir\n7\t(tests/unit/) rather than the project root. That dependency was undocumented and\n8\tunprotected; this file makes it explicit.\n9\t\"\"\"\n10\t\n11\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n12\t\n13\timport sys\n14\tfrom pathlib import Path\n15\t\n16\tPROJECT_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\n17\t\n18\tif str(PROJECT_ROOT) not in sys.path:\n19\t    sys.path.insert(0, str(PROJECT_ROOT))\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"908c0fb5-3108-4d6f-a1a1-3f2f79af6fb0","uuid":"2c18c401-8eda-4cd0-96ae-d16864a1ada7","timestamp":"2026-10-07T22:29:56.353Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/shane/Projects/k-12Harness/tests/conftest.py","content":"\"\"\"Make the repo root importable, whatever pytest was invoked as.\n\nWithout this, `from evals import ...` / `from config import settings` resolve only\nbecause CI happens to run `python -m pytest` — the `-m` flag puts the CWD on\nsys.path. A bare `pytest tests/` from the repo root fails to import, because\npytest's default `prepend` import mode adds only the test file's own rootdir\n(tests/unit/) rather than the project root. That dependency was undocumented and\nunprotected; this file makes it explicit.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nPROJECT_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\n\nif str(PROJECT_ROOT) not in sys.path:\n    sys.path.insert(0, str(PROJECT_ROOT))\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":20}}}
